   "color": "#d6e4f5",
   "text": "`customer · credentials`\n*«Aggregate Root» «Entity»*\n**Credentials**\n---\n+ resendMessage: string | null\n+ requirements: CredentialRequirements\n+ token: CredentialsToken | null\n+ emailPattern\n+ sessionEmailCookieKey\n+ registrationRequirements\n+ newPasswordRequirements\n+ validation\n+ passwordReset\n+ _email\n+ _password\n+ _confirmPassword\n---\n+ email(): string\n+ email(value: string)\n+ password(): string\n+ password(value: string)\n+ confirmPassword(): string\n+ confirmPassword(value: string)\n+ toJSON(): CredentialsJson\n+ isUpdatable(): boolean\n+ isPersistable(): boolean\n+ isAuthenticatable(): boolean\n+ isLoggedIn(): boolean\n+ newPasswordRequired(): boolean\n+ issueSessionToken(): void\n+ passwordRequirements(purpose: PasswordPurpose): PasswordRequirements\n+ missingRequirements(purpose: PasswordPurpose): CredentialRequirement[]\n+ unmetEmailRequirements(): RequirementKey[]\n+ register(): Promise<this>\n+ copyValidationFromStored(stored: Credentials): void\n+ authenticateCredentials(): Promise<this>\n+ requestTemporaryPassword(): Promise<this>\n+ setNewPassword(): Promise<this>\n+ askForNewPassword(stored: Credentials, repository: CredentialsRepository): Promise<this>\n+ signOut(): Promise<void>\n+ requireRepository(): CredentialsRepository\n+ unmetSignInRequirements(): CredentialRequirement[]\n+ failure(operation: CredentialsOperation, requirement: CredentialRequirement, detail: string): CredentialsException",
